  "definition_ja": "a³ − b³ の形の式。(a − b)(a² + ab + b²) と因数分解できる。",
  "definition_en": "An expression of the form a³ − b³, which factors as (a − b)(a² + ab + b²).",
  "latex": "a^3 - b^3 = (a - b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)",
  "spoken_en": "a cubed minus b cubed equals the quantity a minus b, times the quantity a squared plus a b plus b squared",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "x cubed minus 64 is a difference of cubes, because 64 is 4 cubed.",
      "ja": "x³ − 64 は立方の差。64 は 4 の 3 乗だからね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Factor the difference of cubes 8y³ − 125.",
      "ja": "立方の差 8y³ − 125 を因数分解せよ。",
